ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Por cierto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿qué te parece mi casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}La mires por donde la mires,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
la tengo impecable.
No solo cuido el diseño interior,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}también he puesto mucho esfuerzo
en el exterior.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Es el amor de mi vida!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Estoy reconociendo el terreno.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} decía que había
muchas trampas enterradas
alrededor de su casa.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Igual eran paranoias suyas,
pero no cuesta nada comprobarlo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sto perlustrando la zona.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} mi ha detto che ci sono
un sacco di trappole qui intorno a
casa sua!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Forse è solo paranoia, ma meglio
che controlli comunque!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Je{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} He visto tu tienda de campaña.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}No está nada mal.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Cuando yo me independicé, también
empecé viviendo más en contacto
con la naturaleza y todo eso.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Cosas de juventud! Mírame ahora:
propietario de mi pequeña fortaleza.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ya llegarás,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Secondo me, una casa come
la tua basta e avanza a qualcuno
che vive da solo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Pensi di volerla{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ristrutturare{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ancora?{{TAG:0008:0005:1A0015001B002800}}
Penso proprio di sì.
Per ora no.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Tek başına yaşıyorsan bence seninki
kadar bir ev fazlasıyla yeter{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Daha fazla{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tadilat{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yapmayı düşünüyor musun?{{TAG:0008:0005:1A0015001B002800}}
Tabii!
Şimdilik hayır...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La casa de {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} impresiona
bastante cuando la ves de cerca.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ya solo el terreno cuesta un bayizal.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Debe de estar forrad{{TAG:000E:0005:02006F0002006100}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quand'ero piccolo e volevo andare
in spiaggia, non usavo la discesa.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Saltavo giù dalla scogliera e via!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ripensandoci, come facevo a
uscirne con solo un paio di lividi?!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Re-Tail {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}building sure stands
out{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It makes my eyes hurt!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}At the same time, if I don't look at
that pink monstrosity once a day,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I don't feel my day is complete!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}No hay en todo el pueblo
un edificio más hortera
que la tienda de reciclaje.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pero en fin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} esa casa rosa
mantiene a flote la economía.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Mejor no meterse con ella!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}The boat dock has long been a site
of fateful reunions and good-byes.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}You'd see people wait for those
who'd never come home or people
who'd try to stop someone leaving{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}These days,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}the drama you see in
town seems kinda tame, doesn't it?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Questo molo è stato teatro
di innumerevoli incontri e addii.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}In passato, la gente aspettava quelli
che non tornavano più, o tentava di
fermare gente che voleva partire{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}E oggi dov'è la passione? Dove sono
le emozioni, i sentimenti?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}For some reason, I always stand a
little straighter when I pass by the
police station.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, do you do that too?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's not like I've got a really guilty
conscience or anything{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Now that I think about it,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}I'm not
sure why I do it,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Cada vez que paso por delante de la
comisaría,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} me entra un comecome
raro y camino todo tieso.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿A ti no te pasa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Y mira que no he hecho nada malo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Es una sensación muy rara,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Wenn ich an der Polizeiwache hier
vorbeikomme, strecke ich immer
unbewusst den Rücken durch.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Kennst du das, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Muss wohl mein Respekt vor den
hart arbeitenden Beamten sein{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:000C:}}BWA HA HA HA HA HA HA HA
HA HA HA HA HA HA HA HA,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quando cammino da queste parti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
vengo sempre assalito da un aroma
intenso{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Senza che me ne accorga, i miei
piedi mi portano dritto verso
il bancone del caffè!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}My image of a mayor is someone
