the mayor of {{TAG:0005:0005:}}, yeah?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:000E:0006:06004D0061006E000A0057006F006D0061006E00}} of the people!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Io pensavo che il sindaco di
una città passasse tutto il giorno
